<title>BRAZIL: Motta sees Telebras break-up in 1997.</title>
<headline>Motta sees Telebras break-up in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Communications Minister Sergio Motta said Friday he foresees federal telecommunications giant Telebras being split into four regional units, plus long-distance unit Embratel, and partially sold off in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;We aim to sell in 1997 Embratel and the biggest regional telecoms, and, in 1998, the other three,&quot; Motta told a news conference.</p>
</text>
